This repository contains a mixed-license dataset. No single license applies to every record or to the repository as a whole.

For each record, follow its publication_rights and the corresponding entry in sources.json. See LICENSES.md, LICENSE_STATUS.md, and ATTRIBUTION.md for the release-wide summary. The CAICT QA-record reuse authorization is dataset-owner-attested and does not grant a license to underlying reports. No source report PDF or media is redistributed.

The active v2.2.0 release contains only the 2,355-record Gold subset. The frozen v2.1.0 package and earlier release snapshots are retained under history/ for reproducibility and may have different record counts, review status, and recommendation status.
